    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. I noticed you made some pretty specific connections there between the \"heritage\" vibe and certain demographics vs the \"street\" vibe. Why do you think those two consumer profiles have such different racial and cultural characteristics? Is there a fundamental difference in the \"aesthetic\" of class between them?",
